  "instructions": [
    "Rinse and drain the chickpeas and set aside.",
    "Place frozen corn in a pot of boiling water and blanch for 2 minutes, then drain.",
    "In a bowl, combine the cooked rice, chickpeas, blanched corn, ground annatto, smoked paprika, soy sauce, lime juice, and olive oil and mix until evenly coated.",
    "Season the mixture with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the bean bowl mixture to a serving bowl and top with diced avocado.",
    "Sprinkle chopped cilantro over the bowl for freshness.",
    "Garnish with an extra squeeze of lime if desired.",
    "Serve immediately for a midnight snack craving."
